flowchart TB
  accTitle: Herdr sessions, workspaces, tabs, and panes
  accDescr: A terminal client connects to a background Herdr session. A project workspace contains development and review tabs, whose panes run a coding agent, tests, and Git inspection. A workspace does not isolate the filesystem.

  client["Terminal client<br/>Display and input"]
  session["Session: background server<br/>Owns panes and processes"]
  workspace["Workspace: lab project<br/>Organization, no filesystem isolation"]
  dev["Tab: development"]
  review["Tab: review"]
  agent["Pane: coding agent<br/>Edit a scoped module"]
  tests["Pane: tests<br/>Run existing checks"]
  diff["Pane: inspect results<br/>git diff and logs"]
  client --> session --> workspace
  workspace --> dev
  workspace --> review
  dev --> agent
  dev --> tests
  review --> diff
